WEBVTT

00:12:57.185 --> 00:13:00.386
takes the life of all humanity.

00:13:00.386 --> 00:13:07.582
Anyone who saves a life, saves the life of all humanity.

00:13:07.582 --> 00:13:10.652
And he'd commit himself fully

00:13:10.652 --> 00:13:17.672
to the hard and thorny process of making peace.

00:13:17.672 --> 00:13:19.107
Thank you.

00:13:19.107 --> 00:13:23.506
(Applause)

00:13:23.506 --> 00:13:27.506
Thank you. (Applause)